    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Meeting requests** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and your email.\n3. Connect Gmail (trigger and any Gmail node), Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. The trigger checks unread mail matching `in:inbox -from:me (meeting OR call OR catch up OR schedule OR availability)` every minute. Change that search in **New email** to match your inbox.\n5. Send yourself a test from another address, check the result, then switch to **Active**. Nothing is ever sent to customers: replies are saved as drafts.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "1f3d2dfb-2d1d-5f28-ad45-97024ebaebe6",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -560
      ]
    }
